Add terminating NULL to lookup path to pdf_dict_getl().

Commit 091a16c85441af44680a54182cb27c9c8c9a9555 added a call to
pdf_dict_getl() accidentally forgot to add the terminating NULL
to the dict key lookup path. This causes a complaint when mupdf is
compiled by clang-17 as done by oss-fuzz.

This fixes oss-fuzz issue 69502.
